      "title": "CQL: take into account NULL and unset values",
      "message": "CQL: take into account NULL and unset values\n\nConfusingly, their length is -1 or -2...\nThis now allows to properly parse rows without metadata.\n\nSigned-off-by: Yaniv Kaul <mykaul@gmail.com>\n",
      "author_name": "Yaniv Kaul",
      "author_email": "yaniv.kaul@scylladb.com",
