      "parent_ids": [
        "f0462182da63155ffde38d51da7dbedc9fd2d0a6"
      ],
      "title": "CQL: fix two implementation bugs",
      "message": "CQL: fix two implementation bugs\n\nOne is simply copy-pasta, that we did not indicate the correct subtree variable to use.\nThe other is misuse of when/how to add a substree. It doesn't fully fix parsing without metadata, but it makes it slightly better (we do not crash).\n\nSigned-off-by: Yaniv Kaul <mykaul@gmail.com>\n",
      "author_name": "Yaniv Kaul",
      "author_email": "yaniv.kaul@scylladb.com",
      "authored_date": "2024-04-21T15:22:19.000+03:00",
